{%- comment -%}
  The words shown where Dawn says "Sold out" (27 Oct 2026).

  Whisky only ships to the UK and US, but the Europe market stays active because
  Printful merch ships there. Shopify marks whisky unavailable for a European
  visitor, and Dawn called that "Sold out", which reads as "out of stock". For a
  visitor whose country we don't ship whisky to, say so instead.

  Countries outside every market are served the UK market, so they never reach
  this branch. If the shipping zones change, update wb_ship_countries here AND the
  wording in locales (products.product.wb_ship_*).

  Accepts:
  - format: 'button' (default) → "Can't ship to Italy" ("your country" past 17 characters)
            'badge'  → "UK & US only" (cards, price badge)
            'flag'   → outputs "no-ship" when we can't ship here, nothing otherwise

  Usage:
  {% render 'wb-sold-out-text' %}
  {% render 'wb-sold-out-text', format: 'badge' %}

  window.variantStrings.soldOut (theme.liquid) renders the button text from here too.
  wb-blend-product.js / wb-single-malt.js compare the button's text with it to tell
  a sold-out button from one their label guards disabled, so the two must match.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign wb_ship_countries = 'GB,US' | split: ','
  assign wb_country = localization.country.iso_code
  assign wb_ships_here = true
  if wb_country != blank
    unless wb_ship_countries contains wb_country
      assign wb_ships_here = false
    endunless
  endif

  if format == 'flag'
    unless wb_ships_here
      echo 'no-ship'
    endunless
  elsif wb_ships_here
    echo 'products.product.sold_out' | t
  elsif format == 'badge'
    echo 'products.product.wb_ship_badge' | t
  else
    assign wb_country_name = localization.country.name
    if wb_country == 'NL'
      assign wb_country_name = 'the ' | append: wb_country_name
    endif
    # Full-width button on a 375px phone holds one line up to ~17 characters of name
    # ("North Macedonia" fits, "Bosnia & Herzegovina" wraps), so longer names go generic.
    if wb_country_name.size > 17
      assign wb_country_name = 'products.product.wb_ship_your_country' | t
    endif
    echo 'products.product.wb_ship_cant' | t: country: wb_country_name
  endif
-%}
